# The main window of the feature-rich fixture repository (branches, merges, tags, stashes, a remote, a merge in
# progress with staged, unstaged, untracked and conflicted files), dark and light, at 1280x720.
# Compare the screenshots with the Gitnuro layout specs (07, 08, 09).
resize 1280x720
open repository rich
wait idle
shot main-dark
set theme light
wait idle
shot main-light
set theme dark
wait idle
assert no error
